 "response": {
  "text": "Haan, India mein men’s formal shirts ke liye main brands ko roughly is tarah rank karunga:\n\n| Brand | Best for | Approx. budget |\n|---|---|---:|\n| **Louis Philippe** | Premium, classy corporate look | ₹2,000–₹4,500+ |\n| **Arrow** | Sharp, traditional formal look | ₹1,500–₹4,000 |\n| **Van Heusen** | **Best all-rounder / daily office** | ₹1,000–₹3,000 |\n| **Raymond** | Classic, sophisticated look | ₹1,200–₹3,500 |\n| **Blackberrys** | Slim, modern & sharp fit | ₹1,500–₹3,500 |\n| **Park Avenue** | Good value, everyday formal | ₹800–₹2,500 |\n| **Peter England** | **Budget-friendly** | ₹800–₹2,000 |\n| **Allen Solly** | Modern/formal-casual office wear | ₹1,000–₹2,500 |\n\n\nCurrent 2026 comparisons also consistently place Van Heusen, Louis Philippe, Arrow, Raymond, Peter England and Park Avenue among the stronger Indian formal-shirt options. [www.flickonclick.com](https://www.flickonclick.com/best-formal-shirt-brands/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### Meri personal recommendation\n- **₹800–1,500:** Peter England / Park Avenue\n- **₹1,500–2,500:** **Van Heusen** ⭐\n- **₹2,500–4,000:** **Arrow / Louis Philippe**\n- **Premium corporate look:** **Louis Philippe**\n- **Slim & modern look:** Blackberrys\n\n### [Van Heusen Men Solid Formal]()\n*₹840*\n\n### [Louis Philippe Men Shirt]()\n*₹1,724*\n\n### [Raymond Men's Slim Fit Formal Shirt]()\n*₹1,057*\n\n### [Park Avenue Men Slim Fit Solid Formal Shirt]()\n*₹919*\n\n### [Peter England Men's Slim Fit Formal Shirt]()\n*₹1,423*\n\n**Agar sirf 3 shirts leni hain**, main **1 white + 1 light blue + 1 very light pink/blue stripe** lunga. Solid colours sabse versatile rahenge, especially interviews, office meetings aur formal occasions ke liye. [www.flickonclick.com](https://www.flickonclick.com/best-formal-shirt-brands/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nAap apna **budget (₹1000, ₹2000, ₹3000 ya ₹5000 per shirt)** aur **fit (slim/regular)** bata do, main us budget mein **5–7 best shirts** choose karke de sakta hoon.",
